{"seq":1,"slug":"mass-radius-density","title":"质量半径与密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/characterization/mass-radius-density","wordCount":1549,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"质量半径与密度\">质量半径与密度</h1><p>知道一颗行星有多重、多大，本身只是两个数字；把它们除一下得到密度，才第一次触及一个根本问题：这颗行星是石头、是水、还是气球？质量来自<a href=\"../detection/radial-velocity\">视向速度法</a>（或凌星时刻变化），半径来自<a href=\"../detection/transit-method\">凌星法</a>，两者相乘相除得到的平均密度，是判断行星整体成分的第一把、也往往是唯一一把钥匙。本节讲如何从质量与半径出发，借助质量-半径关系图，把一颗行星归入岩石、水世界、气态巨行星或某种中间态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>平均密度把「重多少」与「大多少」合成一个对成分敏感的量。但密度并非成分的唯一解——同一密度可能对应不同的内部结构，这种简并贯穿全节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[RV 给质量 Mp] --&gt; C[平均密度 rho]&#10;  B[凌星给半径 Rp] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D{密度落在哪条曲线}&#10;  D --&gt; E[高密度 纯铁或岩石]&#10;  D --&gt; F[中密度 含水或厚大气]&#10;  D --&gt; G[低密度 气态巨行星]&#10;  E --&gt; H[在 M-R 图上定位]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[内部结构仍有简并&lt;br/&gt;需大气数据破解]\">flowchart TD\n  A[RV 给质量 Mp] --&gt; C[平均密度 rho]\n  B[凌星给半径 Rp] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D{密度落在哪条曲线}\n  D --&gt; E[高密度 纯铁或岩石]\n  D --&gt; F[中密度 含水或厚大气]\n  D --&gt; G[低密度 气态巨行星]\n  E --&gt; H[在 M-R 图上定位]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[内部结构仍有简并&lt;br/&gt;需大气数据破解]</pre><p>下表给出太阳系与典型系外行星的密度坐标，作为成分判读的参照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>天体</th>\n<th>平均密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathrm{g/cm^3})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>主要成分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地球</td>\n<td>5.51</td>\n<td>铁核 + 硅酸盐幔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水星</td>\n<td>5.43</td>\n<td>富铁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海王星</td>\n<td>1.64</td>\n<td>冰 + 氢氦包层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>土星</td>\n<td>0.69</td>\n<td>氢氦为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型热木星</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3\\sim1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氢氦，常被恒星加热膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"平均密度怎么算-又意味着什么\">平均密度怎么算，又意味着什么</h2><p>平均密度的定义朴素得近乎平庸，威力却在于它对成分的敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{M_p}{\\frac{4}{3}\\pi R_p^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4785em;vertical-align:-1.1182em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2649em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1182em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>密度正比于质量、反比于半径的立方，因此半径的微小误差会被放大三倍传入密度——这也是为什么<a href=\"../detection/transit-method\">凌星法</a>中恒星半径标定的精度如此关键。一颗与地球同密度（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.5\\,\\mathrm{g/cm^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）的行星几乎必然是岩石+金属的混合体；密度降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\,\\mathrm{g/cm^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 暗示大量的水或冰；降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\mathrm{g/cm^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以下则必有厚重的氢氦包层。注意密度只给出体平均，无法分辨「小铁核+厚幔」与「大铁核+薄幔」——这是内部结构的固有简并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量-半径关系图-行星的成分地图\">质量-半径关系图：行星的成分地图</h2><p>把大量行星画在以质量为横轴、半径为纵轴的图上，就得到行星科学最重要的诊断工具之一：质量-半径关系图（mass-radius diagram）。不同成分的行星沿不同的理论曲线分布——纯铁球在最下方（同质量下最小最致密），纯硅酸盐稍上，含水世界更上，氢氦主导的巨行星在最顶部。</p>\n<p>一个反直觉的特征是：对气态巨行星，半径几乎不随质量增长，甚至在木星质量以上因电子简并压而略微缩小。可近似用分段幂律刻画岩石行星区：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.27</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>岩石行星，</mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≲</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_p \\propto M_p^{\\,\\alpha}, \\quad \\alpha \\approx 0.27 \\;(\\text{岩石行星，} M_p \\lesssim 2\\,M_\\oplus)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0975em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">岩石行星，</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把一颗实测行星点落在图上，看它最接近哪条成分曲线，就能初步判定成分。但许多点落在曲线之间的「简并带」——例如一颗中等密度的行星，既可能是含厚水层的水世界，也可能是岩石核外裹一层薄氢氦。下表把常见密度区间与典型成分对照起来，便于快速判读：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平均密度区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathrm{g/cm^3})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型成分</th>\n<th>代表天体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≳</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gtrsim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>铁核 + 硅酸盐幔</td>\n<td>地球、水星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>岩石 + 大量水/冰</td>\n<td>水世界（假说）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>冰幔 + 薄氢氦包层</td>\n<td>次海王星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氢氦为主，被恒星加热</td>\n<td>热木星、土星</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要打破这种简并，必须引入第三维信息：大气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时密度不够用-呼唤大气数据\">何时密度不够用：呼唤大气数据</h2><p>质量-半径关系的天花板，是它无法区分「不同成分组合恰好给出相同密度」的情形。一颗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、密度中等的次海王星，可以是「岩石核 + 1% 氢氦」也可以是「冰幔 + 厚水蒸气大气」，两者在 M-R 图上几乎重合，却代表截然不同的形成历史与宜居前景。</p>\n<p>破解之道是测量大气的平均分子量与标高（scale height）：富氢的轻大气标高大、透射光谱特征强，富水或富二氧化碳的重大气标高小、特征弱。换言之，同样落在简并带里的两颗行星，富氢者会展示一条特征鲜明的透射谱，富水者则谱线低平——大气测量因此能直接区分二者的成分，这是密度本身永远做不到的。因此现代行星表征是「质量+半径+大气」的三角测量，<a href=\"atmosphere-characterization\">大气表征</a>提供 M-R 图给不出的成分约束。这种联合分析也是判断一颗次海王星究竟是「迷你海王星」还是潜在宜居的「海洋世界」的关键，直接关系到<a href=\"../habitability/habitable-zone\">宜居带与宜居性</a>的判读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"半径鸿沟的伏笔\">半径鸿沟的伏笔</h2><p>当把小行星按半径作直方图，会发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\sim2\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处出现一道明显的「峡谷」——行星数量在此显著偏少，把小行星分成「超级地球」与「次海王星」两族。这个半径鸿沟（radius valley）不是测量偏差，而是行星演化留下的真实印记，通常归因于近轨道行星的氢氦包层被恒星高能辐射剥离。它把质量-半径关系与行星演化、形成史紧密联系起来，其成因与族群划分由<a href=\"../formation/planet-diversity\">行星类型与多样性</a>详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平均密度由 RV 测得的质量与凌星测得的半径联合算出，是判断行星整体成分的第一把钥匙。</li>\n<li>密度对半径误差极为敏感（三次方放大），且只给体平均，无法分辨内部结构的细节简并。</li>\n<li>质量-半径关系图按成分把行星分到铁、岩石、水、氢氦不同曲线上，但「简并带」中的行星需要额外信息才能定性。</li>\n<li>打破简并需引入<a href=\"atmosphere-characterization\">大气表征</a>给出的平均分子量与标高，形成「质量+半径+大气」三角测量。</li>\n<li>小行星半径分布中的半径鸿沟揭示了大气逃逸对行星演化的塑造，详见<a href=\"../formation/planet-diversity\">行星类型与多样性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量半径与密度","id":"质量半径与密度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平均密度怎么算，又意味着什么","id":"平均密度怎么算-又意味着什么"},{"level":2,"text":"质量-半径关系图：行星的成分地图","id":"质量-半径关系图-行星的成分地图"},{"level":2,"text":"何时密度不够用：呼唤大气数据","id":"何时密度不够用-呼唤大气数据"},{"level":2,"text":"半径鸿沟的伏笔","id":"半径鸿沟的伏笔"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直接成像与微引力透镜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/detection/imaging-microlensing"},"next":{"title":"大气表征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/characterization/atmosphere-characterization"}}